      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Sirius is a GPU-native SQL engine released as a DuckDB core extension through collaboration between NVIDIA and DuckLabs.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/get-started-with-gpu-accelerated-duckdb-analytics-using-the-sirius-core-extension/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T17:09:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-24T20:39:33.175Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Benchmark tests using TPC-H queries at scale factors up to 10 TB showed 3.25x to 5.50x speedups and up to 79% lower query-time compute cost with tuned two-GPU configurations.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/get-started-with-gpu-accelerated-duckdb-analytics-using-the-sirius-core-extension/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T17:09:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-24T20:39:33.175Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Install the Sirius core extension to begin accelerating analytical queries.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/get-started-with-gpu-accelerated-duckdb-analytics-using-the-sirius-core-extension/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T17:09:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-24T20:39:33.175Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "NVIDIA and DuckLabs collaborated to release Sirius as a DuckDB core extension, bringing GPU acceleration to DuckDB’s analytical query engine.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/get-started-with-gpu-accelerated-duckdb-analytics-using-the-sirius-core-extension/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T17:09:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-24T20:39:33.175Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This post introduces the core extension, shows you how to run your first GPU query, and explains how Sirius integrates with DuckDB.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/get-started-with-gpu-accelerated-duckdb-analytics-using-the-sirius-core-extension/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T17:09:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-24T20:39:33.175Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The core extension brings this capability into DuckDB’s standard workflow: install Sirius, load it, and run your queries.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/get-started-with-gpu-accelerated-duckdb-analytics-using-the-sirius-core-extension/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T17:09:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-24T20:39:33.175Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We evaluated Sirius against CPU-based DuckDB using cold runs of queries derived from the TPC-H benchmark, with data stored in Amazon S3.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/get-started-with-gpu-accelerated-duckdb-analytics-using-the-sirius-core-extension/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T17:09:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-24T20:39:33.175Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Cold-run TPC-H query runtime and compute cost for Sirius and CPU-based DuckDB at SF100, SF1K, SF3K, and SF10K",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/get-started-with-gpu-accelerated-duckdb-analytics-using-the-sirius-core-extension/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T17:09:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-24T20:39:33.175Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With tuned settings, Sirius running on AWS instances with two NVIDIA GPUs delivered 3.25x to 5.50x speedups over the best tested CPU-based DuckDB configurations.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/get-started-with-gpu-accelerated-duckdb-analytics-using-the-sirius-core-extension/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T17:09:28.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-24T20:39:33.175Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
